      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram: \nMoolavar: Chandra Chooda Perumal / Nilaattingal Tundattan\nThayaar: Nillathingal Tundattayar\nVimanam: Purushasooktha Vimanam\nPushkarani: Chandra Pushkarani\n\n***Located inside the Ekambareshwarar Temple\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nTirumangai Azhwar: 1 pasuram",
